## Case study: IR Energy, from 2–3 enquiries a month to 50

IR Energy is a South Wales renewable energy installer. They had a website, but it was bringing in only two to three quote requests a month. We redesigned their homepage and ran a three-month local SEO campaign, building 20 ranking pages for searches across South Wales, including Cardiff and Merthyr Tydfil.

- **2–3 → 50** tracked enquiries, from two to three a month to 50 in three months
- **+76%** clicks from Google
- **+164%** search impressions

Read the full story in our [IR Energy SEO case study](/blog/ir-energy-seo-case-study/) or see the [IR Energy project in our portfolio](/portfolio/ir-energy/).

